1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,565
Well, everybody, the History Society Functions Committee welcomes you all.

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,800
I must say that I am surprised.

3
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:10,240
There are so many people here tonight and so many new faces!

4
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:15,300
Let me say that I believe you have made an excellent decision to attend this meeting.

5
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:20,520
Our speaker tonight will be one of the world's leading experts on Anglo-Saxon issues.

6
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:27,965
He's Professor Michael Sutherland, who has kindly consented to come all the way from the University of Essex to speak to us.

7
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:36,430
Professor Sutherland is not only an expert on the Anglo-Saxon period but also one of the most interesting speakers I have ever met.

8
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:39,670
So please welcome Professor Michael Sutherland.
